flowchart LR
  A[Commit] --> B[Build + codegen from schema]
  B --> C[Unit tests]
  C --> D{"Schema compatibility<br/>vs registry<br/><i>syntactic</i>"}
  D -->|Incompatible| X["Fail fast<br/>the 10 most valuable seconds"]
