  E --> F[Provision ephemeral<br/>namespaced topics]
  F --> G[Integration tests<br/>on Confluent Cloud]
  G --> TD[Tear down namespace]
  TD --> I[Publish immutable artifact]
  I --> J[Register schema]
  J --> K["Deploy: shadow → canary → promote"]
